{"id": "17-1109-2-11", "zh": "在名为 la 的词干之后，复数格尾 yo 可选地替换为 vo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1109-12-19", "zh": "由于取了“kāra”一词，yo 也会变为 no。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1109-20-24", "zh": "取 ca 一词，是为了在某些情况下排除这条规则。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1109-25-38", "zh": "或者说，取 ca 是为了承接 no 的规定；因此，在 jantu、sabbaññū 等词之后，yo 也变为 no。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1109-39-42", "zh": "vā 一词表示有限定的可选（vavatthitavibhāsā）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1109-43-44", "zh": "因此——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1110-2-8", "zh": "在 bhikkhu 等词之后，yo 一定变为 vo；在 hetu 等词之后，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1111-2-11", "zh": "则是可选的；在 amu 等词之后，既不变为 vo，也不变为 no。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1112-2-12", "zh": "“attaṃ”与“akatarasso”两项也延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1113-2-8", "zh": "156. 在 ve、vo 之前，la 也变为 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1114-2-10", "zh": "当 ve、vo 在后时，不是由缩短而来的 la 也变为 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1114-11-18", "zh": "bhikkhavo，bho bhikkhu，bhavanto bhikkhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1115-2-3", "zh": "格尾不脱落时——", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1116-2-9", "zh": "157. 在不是由缩短而来的 la 之后，呼格的 yo 变为 ve、vo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1117-2-14", "zh": "在不是由缩短而来的 la 之后，用于呼格的 yo 替换为 ve 和 vo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1117-15-17", "zh": "（la）变为 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1117-18-21", "zh": "bhavanto bhikkhave、bhikkhavo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1117-22-32", "zh": "依“在 jha、la 之后，aṃ 和 mo 变为 niggahīta”一条，变为 niggahīta。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1118-2-41", "zh": "bhikkhuṃ，bhikkhū、bhikkhavo，bhikkhunā，bhikkhūhi、bhikkhūbhi、bhikkhuhi、bhikkhubhi，bhikkhuno、bhikkhussa，bhikkhūnaṃ、bhikkhunaṃ，bhikkhunā、bhikkhusmā、bhikkhumhā，bhikkhūhi、bhikkhūbhi、bhikkhuhi、bhikkhubhi，bhikkhuno、bhikkhussa，bhikkhūnaṃ、bhikkhunaṃ，bhikkhumhi、bhikkhusmiṃ，bhikkhūsu、bhikkhusu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1119-2-22", "zh": "setu、ketu、rāhu、bhānu、paṅgu、ucchu、veḷu、maccu、sindhu、bandhu、neru、meru、sattu、kāru、hetu、jantu、ruru、paṭu 等词也同样变化。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1120-2-6", "zh": "hetu、jantu 两个词在第一格和第二格上有所不同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1121-2-21", "zh": "hetu，hetū、hetavo、hetuyo，bho hetu，bhonto hetū、hetave、hetavo，hetuṃ，hetū、hetavo、hetuyo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1121-22-25", "zh": "其余与 bhikkhu 相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1122-2-6", "zh": "jantu，jantū、jantavo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1122-7-13", "zh": "由于取了“kāra”一词，yo 也变为 no。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1122-14-31", "zh": "jantuno、jantuyo，bho jantu，jantū、jantave、jantavo，jantuṃ，jantū、jantavo、jantuno、jantuyo，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1123-2-5", "zh": "satthu 一词的变化有所不同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1123-6-13", "zh": "这里，在“satthu + si”的情况下——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1124-2-9", "zh": "“anto”一词延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1125-2-9", "zh": "158. 在 si 之前，satthu、pitu 等词的末尾变为 ā，si 也脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1126-2-18", "zh": "当 si 在后时，satthu、pitu、mātu、bhātu、dhītu、kattu 等词的末尾变为 ā，并且 si 脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1126-19-20", "zh": "satthā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-1127-2-10", "zh": "“satthu、pitu 等词的”是管辖语（adhikāra）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1128-2-7", "zh": "159. 在其他格尾之前变为 āra。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1129-2-11", "zh": "在 si 以外的其他格尾之前，satthu、pitu 等词的末尾变为 āra。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1129-12-17", "zh": "用“āratta”这种表示抽象的说法，是为了显示在某些情况下这条规则并不固定。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1130-2-4", "zh": "“āra”一词延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1131-2-8", "zh": "160. 在其后，yo 变为 o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1132-2-11", "zh": "在替换而来的 āra 之后，所有的 yo 都替换为 o。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1133-2-14", "zh": "由于取了 tu 一词，在其他的 catu、ubha、nadī、go 等词之后，yo 也变为 o，并有元音脱落等变化。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1133-15-16", "zh": "satthāro。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-1134-2-10", "zh": "呼格时，依“akārapitādyantānamā”一条，变为 ā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1134-11-31", "zh": "以“ge rassaṃ”为管辖，依“ākāro vā”一条可选地变短，并且格尾脱落。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-1134-32-44", "zh": "bho sattha、bho satthā，bhavanto satthāro，satthāraṃ，satthāre、satthāro。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1135-2-10", "zh": "“tato”一词也延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1136-2-7", "zh": "161. nā 变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1137-2-10", "zh": "在替换而来的 āra 之后，格尾 nā 替换为 ā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1137-11-17", "zh": "satthārā；satthunā 则是借“āratta”这种表示抽象的说法而成立的。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1137-18-20", "zh": "satthārehi、satthārebhi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-1138-2-17", "zh": "从“vā naṃmhi”一条取来的“vā”延续下来。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1139-2-10", "zh": "162. 在 sa 之前变为 u，sa 也脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1140-2-16", "zh": "当 sa 在后时，satthu、pitu 等词的末尾可选地变为 u，并且 sa 脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1140-17-19", "zh": "这是对 āra 替换的例外规则。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1140-20-24", "zh": "satthu；在其他情况下，借表示抽象的说法，不变为 āra。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1140-25-27", "zh": "satthussa、satthuno。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-1141-2-9", "zh": "“ārattaṃ”延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1142-2-7", "zh": "163. 在 naṃ 之前可选。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1143-2-11", "zh": "当格尾 naṃ 在后时，satthu、pitu 等词的末尾可选地变为 āra。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1143-12-13", "zh": "satthārānaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-1144-2-12", "zh": "不变为 āra 时，“vā naṃmhi”延续下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1145-2-6", "zh": "164. satthu 的末尾也变为 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1146-2-21", "zh": "当格尾 naṃ 在后时，satthu 一词的末尾以及 pitu 等词的末尾可选地变为 a；再次提到 satthu，是为了对 satthu 作固定的规定。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1146-22-23", "zh": "satthānaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-1147-2-14", "zh": "依“在 amha、tumha、antu、rāja、brahma、atta、sakha、satthu、pitu 等词之后，smā 可选地变为 nā”一条，格尾 smā 变为 nā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1147-15-26", "zh": "satthārā，satthārehi、satthārebhi，satthu、satthuno、satthussa，satthārānaṃ、satthānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1148-2-9", "zh": "“ārato”延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1149-2-7", "zh": "165. 在其后，smiṃ 变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1150-2-10", "zh": "在替换而来的 āra 之后，格尾 smiṃ 替换为 i。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1150-11-19", "zh": "再次取 tato 一词，表示在其他词之后，格尾 smiṃ 也会变为 i。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1150-20-25", "zh": "例如：bhuvi、divi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1151-2-8", "zh": "166. 在 i 之前，āra 变短。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1152-2-11", "zh": "当 i 在后时，替换而来的 āra 变短：satthari，satthāresu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1153-2-24", "zh": "同样：kattā，kattāro，bho katta、bho kattā，bhavanto kattāro，kattāraṃ，kattāre、kattāro，kattārā，kattārehi、kattārebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1153-25-39", "zh": "依“在 sa 之前变为 u，sa 也脱落”一条，变为 u，并且 sa 脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1153-40-71", "zh": "kattu、kattuno、kattussa，kattārānaṃ、kattānaṃ、kattūnaṃ、kattunaṃ，kattārā，kattārehi、kattārebhi，kattu、kattuno、kattussa，kattārānaṃ、kattānaṃ、kattūnaṃ、kattunaṃ，kattari，kattāresu，不变为 āra 时则是 kattūsu、kattusu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1154-2-3", "zh": "同样——", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1155-2-11", "zh": "bhattu、vattu、netu、sotu，ñātu、jetu、chettu、bhettu，", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1155-12-19", "zh": "dātu、dhātu、nattu、boddhu，以及 viññāpetu 等词也是如此。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1156-2-12", "zh": "“在 sa 之前变为 u，sa 也脱落”一条延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1157-2-6", "zh": "167. saka、mandhātu 等词也是如此。", "confidence": 65}
